---
### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Entities
:Scene1 a :AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :Foggy ;
    :hasRoadCondition :Wet .

:Vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :hasColor "Red" ;
    :hasType "Car" ;
    :hasPosition :DrivingLane ;
    :hasOccupant :HumanDriver .

:HumanDriver a :Driver ;
    :hasHandPosition "OnSteeringWheel" ;
    :hasAttire :Casual .

:SteeringWheel a :VehicleComponent ;
    :isPartOf :Vehicle1 ;
    :hasState "Gripped" .

# Relationships
:Vehicle1 :isInEnvironment :Scene1 .
:HumanDriver :isIn :Vehicle1 .
:HumanDriver :interactsWith :SteeringWheel .
:Scene1 :hasObstacle :NoneVisible .
:Scene1 :hasTrafficCondition :LowVisibility .
```

